## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] A failing issue dispatches at most three execution attempts automatically.
- [ ] Failure context contains actual check logs or agent/merge failure evidence.
- [ ] Hung checks are skipped only for the active run; ordinary failures still trigger repairs.
- [ ] A stuck agent consumes one attempt and its late response cannot advance the run.
- [ ] The final issue status includes missing validation even if every remaining check was skipped.
- [ ] This slice's behavioral regression tests pass: `bun test tests/integration/07-retries.test.ts`.
- [ ] Type checking and lint pass; no unsupported platform is silently excluded.
